// gramdoc: structured documentation comments (/** ... */) for gram.
// Editors inject the gramdoc language into each doc comment.
// https://github.com/gram-data/tree-sitter-gramdoc

// --- A node: description, name, label, properties, alias, reference ---
// Cardinality, constraints and other structure are not documentation: they
// belong in annotations on the definition, not in the comment.

/**
 * Person
 *
 * A human individual.
 *
 * @label Person The kind of thing this describes.
 * @alias Human
 * @alias Individual
 * @reference https://schema.org/Person A comparable external definition.
 * @property name "name": The full name of the person. (@aliases: "full name")
 * @property born
 *   Year of birth. Descriptions continue onto following lines
 *   until the next tag.
 */
(:Person {name: "STRING!", born: "INTEGER"})

// --- The same element in another language ---
// @language applies to the whole comment. A quoted term after the property
// name is its localized name; (@key value) groups at the end are attributes.
// The description of every tag is Markdown.

/**
 * Un être humain.
 *
 * @language "fr"
 * @property name "nom": Le nom complet de la personne. (@aliases: "anon")
 * @property born "naissance": L'année de naissance, par exemple **1815**.
 */
[:Doc | (:Person)]

// --- A relationship, documented by position ---

/**
 * KNOWS
 *
 * A social tie between two people.
 *
 * @label KNOWS
 * @alias ACQUAINTED_WITH
 * @property since "since": When the two people met. (@see [schema.org](https://schema.org/knows))
 * @elements The two acquainted people.
 * @element The person who recorded the acquaintance.
 * @element The person who is known.
 */
[:KNOWS {since: date} | (a:Person), (b:Person)]

// --- A sequence of elements, documented by position ---

/**
 * Team
 *
 * @elements The members of the team.
 * @element The team lead.
 * @element A regular member.
 */
[team:Team | (lead:Person), (member:Person)]

// --- Doc comments also work inside records, before a property ---

(:Account {
  /** The login name, unique across accounts. */
  username: "ada",
  /**
   * When the account was created.
   * @reference https://www.w3.org/TR/xmlschema11-2/#dateTime ISO 8601 timestamps.
   */
  created: datetime`2024-01-01T00:00:00Z`
})

// --- Other tags are accepted and kept as unknown tags ---

/**
 * Draft
 *
 * @deprecated Use Person instead.
 * @since 0.4.0
 */
(:Draft)
